.SH BUGS
See
.I COMPATIBILITY_PROGRESS.md
in the source tree for the option-by-option audit.
Known limitations include partial multi-volume mid-file split, partial
.BR \-\-pax\-option ,
unsupported SELinux, and compressed seek that materializes before seeking.
